OL,3,GNEWSAWeekend service disruption on East
OL,4,ACoast Main Line                        
OL,6,FThameslink and Great Northern rail     
OL,7,Fpassengers are being warned about the  
OL,8,Fclosure of the East Coast Main Line    
OL,9,Fthis weekend due to engineering works. 
OL,11,FThere will be no trains on Saturday or 
OL,12,FSunday between London and Letchworth   
OL,13,FGarden City or Peterborough, with rail 
OL,14,Freplacement services running instead.  
OL,16,FThe work will involve upgrades to      
OL,17,Fdigital signalling technology, which   
OL,18,Fwill be used by more trains next year. 
OL,20,FNetwork Rail said there would be       
OL,21,F"reliability benefits" as a result of  
OL,22,Fthe work.                              
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
